# The Lost Cardian (jeuno 18): GM-set states no play reaches, where the Lua's checks still decide (each a step a GM
# can take). Panta-Putta: The Wonder Magic Set available (fame level 1, no key item) with theLostCardianVar 1: not 30
# (it wants The Wonder Magic Set completed): her 78. This quest completed with the var 1 (The Kind Cardian available):
# not 30 (it wants this quest available): her 78. This quest available again, the var 0, The Kind Cardian accepted
# with theKindCardianVar 2: Panta-Putta's 40 comes before The Kind Cardian's 35, Teigero-Bangero's 29 before its 66.
# Monberaux: this quest completed with the var 2, then 3 (Cook's Pride completed, The Kind Cardian available): not 33 /
# 34 (they want this quest available): no arm.
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-60.8,-0.3,-140.0 job=WAR lvl=75
charvar theLostCardianVar 1
login
trigger Panta-Putta                     # The Wonder Magic Set available, fame level 1: no arm; the var 1: not 30: 78
finish
quest Jeuno.TheWonderMagicSet completed
quest Jeuno.CooksPride completed
quest Jeuno.TheLostCardian completed
trigger Panta-Putta                     # this quest completed, the var 1: not 30; The Kind Cardian available: 78
finish
charvar theLostCardianVar 0
quest Jeuno.TheLostCardian available
quest Jeuno.TheKindCardian accepted
charvar theKindCardianVar 2
trigger Panta-Putta                     # this quest available, the var 0: 40 (before The Kind Cardian's 35)
finish
trigger Teigero-Bangero                 # the turn: 34
finish
trigger Teigero-Bangero                 # this quest available, the var 0: 29 (before The Kind Cardian's 66)
finish                                  # the var 1
warp -40.9,-0.5,-1.9 UpperJeuno         # beside Monberaux
quest Jeuno.TheKindCardian available
quest Jeuno.TheLostCardian completed
charvar theLostCardianVar 2
trigger Monberaux                       # this quest completed, the var 2: not 33; The Kind Cardian available: 109 (28 queued)
finish
finish
charvar theLostCardianVar 3
trigger Monberaux                       # the var 3: not 34: 28
finish
